  "description": "To change of use from a HMO (C4 use) and 2 bed flat to a single family dwelling; as the approval scheme - ref: 2022/2074/P \n\nTo restore the existing front elevation; including replacement of roof tiles, reinstate / repair / replacement / re-decoration of all carpentry works, replacement of all the windows with double glazed timber box sash windows, clean up and re-pointing all brickwork, remove the existing sand/cement rendering with breathable mineral paint\n\nTo demolish existing single storey rear extension; and to replace with a full width single storey rear extension, including new green roof and 2nos flat roof windows.\n\nTo replace the existing roof window at the front elevation with new conservation roof windows; and install 4nos new conservation roof windows; two at the front and two at the rear pitch roof.  \n\nTo restore the existing rear elevation; including replacement of roof tiles, reinstate / repair / replacement / re-decoration of all carpentry works, replace all windows with double glazed timber box sash windows, clean up and re-pointing all brickwork.\n\nInternal alterations; including using the existing loft space as habitable room.\n",
